      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Duchess_Landing%2C_Oklahoma"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Lake Eufaula moderates temperature extremes and promotes riparian environments in the ecology surrounding Duchess Landing.",
